    "report_io_scope": "The child writes its envelope once then returns through main. Parent confirms normal child exit0, exact report file type/owner/link/size, and one exact-size pread before using it. JSON output completion is independently reflected by supervisor exit; neither report asserts its own completed write.",
    "source_scope": "isolated-Linux-owned-temporary-file; authored-owner-model; ordinary-synchronous-callbacks"
  },
  "limits": {
    "failure_cleanup_rule": "No retry or recursive cleanup; a failed supervisor may leave owned temporary names to container containment. That containment is not acknowledged cleanup or recovery.",
